# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NO CAMPAIGN DATA IN GIT.
#
# This directory is the app's runtime state store (DATA_DIR).
# Everything the server reads or writes here is real collection
# data — collector names, timestamped run logs, campus locations,
# rig notes — and none of it belongs in a public repo.
#
# Ignore everything; keep only the directory itself.
# See the README ("Where the data goes") for the expected files.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*

# ...except the scaffolding that defines this directory.
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
